title: "Genesis-Rigorous v1.0.2: A Unified Mean-Field and Exact U(N)-Singlet HMC PyTorch/CUDA Testbed for Emergent Fuzzy-Sphere Geometry, Subregion Entanglement Scaling, and Noncommutative Membrane Response"
