abstract: >-
  An open-source, double-precision PyTorch/CUDA computational testbed unifying
  U(N)-covariant Hartree-Fock-Bogoliubov (HFB) mean-field solvers, strictly traceless
  su(N) Bogoliubov-de Gennes (BdG) link-fermion subregion entanglement scaling, an exact
  U(N)-singlet gauged lattice Hybrid Monte Carlo (HMC) sampler with dynamical Polyakov-loop
  holonomy and zero sign problem, localized adjoint-Dirac versus radial membrane controls,
  matrix-native large-N scaling, U(2) Coulomb-branch Higgs splitting, and fuzzy
  Ginsparg-Wilson chiral index checks, audited by 20 automated tests (T01-T20) and
  accompanied by zero-cheat 5-panel quantum birth/melting visualizations.
